<servinfosub id = "AENLBA0C9B06002001">
<title>
General Notes
</title>
<ptxt>
Welding method and number of welding points are the same on both sides. This repair instruction shows procedure for left side.
</ptxt>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLBA0C9B06002002">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drill out welding spots and remove front fender lower bracket, front fender bracket and front fender rear bracket.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFBA0A9B0023.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "125.182mm" ver = "00" gw = "0" gh = "0"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLBA0C9B06002003">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<attention3>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
